      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Rows: 68 boards/societies as printed (7 Canadian on p. 458, 61 American across pp. 458-459), plus the sub-heading rows 'Canadian' and 'American' and 3 total rows.",
        "The unlabelled sum line above 'Less Canadian Societies' is given the label '[Sum as printed]'. p. 459 begins '(Continued)' and repeats the column heads with sub-heading 'American'; not repeated as a row.",
        "Board names printed over two lines are joined; line-break hyphens removed (e.g. 'Ad-ventists', 'Augus-tana'). '*' and '†' marks kept as printed.",
        "Row 'Mennonite General Conference', 1935: first digit of '21,000' is partly broken in the print but reads as 2.",
        "Row 'China Mennonite Miss. Society', 1929: '10,538' printed slightly below the row line; assigned to this row (the next row, Methodist Episcopal, has its own 1929 figure 503,336).",
        "Total checks (Canadian = first 7 boards; all rows summed with '—' as 0):",
        "1935: all boards sum to 4,206,865 vs printed 4,206,865 — reconciles; Canadian boards sum to 363,828 vs printed Less 363,828 — reconciles; printed total minus Less = 3,843,037 vs Total U.S. 3,843,037 — reconciles",
        "1934: all boards sum to 3,489,969 vs printed 4,144,042 — does NOT reconcile (diff -654,073); Canadian boards sum to 368,584 vs printed Less 366,080 — does NOT reconcile (diff +2,504); printed total minus Less = 3,777,962 vs Total U.S. 3,777,962 — reconciles",
        "1933: all boards sum to 3,976,950 vs printed 3,982,760 — does NOT reconcile (diff -5,810); Canadian boards sum to 365,515 vs printed Less 365,515 — reconciles; printed total minus Less = 3,617,245 vs Total U.S. 3,617,145 — does NOT reconcile (diff +100)",
        "1932: all boards sum to 4,739,210 vs printed 4,743,815 — does NOT reconcile (diff -4,605); Canadian boards sum to 341,024 vs printed Less 341,024 — reconciles; printed total minus Less = 4,402,791 vs Total U.S. 4,402,791 — reconciles",
        "1931: all boards sum to 5,107,171 vs printed 5,161,795 — does NOT reconcile (diff -54,624); Canadian boards sum to 424,971 vs printed Less 424,971 — reconciles; printed total minus Less = 4,736,824 vs Total U.S. 4,736,824 — reconciles",
        "1930: all boards sum to 6,250,025 vs printed 6,253,520 — does NOT reconcile (diff -3,495); Canadian boards sum to 481,805 vs printed Less 471,805 — does NOT reconcile (diff +10,000); printed total minus Less = 5,781,715 vs Total U.S. 5,781,615 — does NOT reconcile (diff +100)",
        "1929: all boards sum to 6,407,207 vs printed 6,407,846 — does NOT reconcile (diff -639); Canadian boards sum to 474,192 vs printed Less 574,192 — does NOT reconcile (diff -100,000); printed total minus Less = 5,833,654 vs Total U.S. 5,833,654 — reconciles",
        "All cells in the non-reconciling columns re-read from fresh crops; readings unchanged. 1934: Presb., U.S.A. prints '—' for 1934, which alone would account for most of the 654,073 shortfall (not filled in). Discrepancies are the source's; nothing corrected.",
        "Check pass CK03: 'Mennonite General Conference' 1935 '21,000' re-read at high zoom. The top arc of the first digit is broken, but the ball terminal at top left, the diagonal down to the left and the flat base stroke all remain; only 2 has that form (7 has no base; 1 has no diagonal). Certain: 2. Value kept."
      ],
